摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Neo-brutalism skin for the DeepSeek Harness Web UI — hard borders, high contrast, two switchable schemes (Blue Command / Aged Newspaper), works in light and dark themes.","id":"gh:1335557891","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-neo-skin","slug":"0nt-one/dsh-neo-skin","topics":["dsh-plugin","neo-brutalism","skin","theme"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Neo-brutalism skin for the DeepSeek Harness Web UI — hard borders, high contrast, two switchable sch"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"emes (Blue Command / Aged Newspaper), works in light and dark themes."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-neo-skin 🧱"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> Neo-brutalism skin for DeepSeek Harness Web UI —\n> 新粗野主义换肤插件：硬边框、高对比、色块分明的粗野主义风格，内置两套方案可随时切换。"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"## Screenshots / 预览"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"| 浅色 · 蓝统治 | 深色 · 蓝统治 | 做旧报纸 |"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"> 截图放 `screenshots/` 目录，文件名对应上表；开发期也可打开仓库里的 `preview.html`\n> 交互对比两套方案 × 浅/深色。"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"| 方案 | Light 浅色 | Dark 深色 |"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| **蓝统治 Blue Command**（默认） | 深蓝侧栏 + 米白纸感 | 蓝黑画布 |\n| **做旧报纸 Aged Newspaper** | 泛黄纸 + 墨字 + 衬线报头 | 报纸夜间"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"*蓝统治 Blue Command**（默认） | 深蓝侧栏 + 米白纸感 | 蓝黑画布 |\n| **做旧报纸 Aged Newspaper** | 泛黄纸 + 墨字 + 衬线报头 | 报纸夜间版 |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## English — What is this?"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"A zero-dependency **client skin plugin** for the DeepSeek Harness Web UI. It stacks a\nneo-brutalism "},{"id":"p10s2","text":"palette and structure over the built-in light/dark themes via the official\n`theme` service — **it ne"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"ver replaces the built-in theme**, so the Appearance row\n(light / dark / system) keeps working and y"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"our skin applies to both palettes."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### Features"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"- 🎨 **Two built-in schemes**, switchable live from Settings → General → *Neo 皮肤*\n(persisted in `loca"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"lStorage`, no reinstall):\n- **Blue Command** — deep-blue sidebar & buttons, blue-black dark mode\n- *"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"*Aged Newspaper** — yellowed paper, ink text, serif editorial type, masthead red\n- 🧱 **Structure lay"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"er** — hard offset shadows (theme-aware black/white), sharp corners,\n2px borders, button press feedb"},{"id":"p12s5","text":"ack\n- 🎛️ **On/off toggle** + scheme picker in the settings row\n- 🎙️ **Adapts `dsh-voice-input`** UI "},{"id":"p12s6","text":"(popover, pills, states) to the skin\n- 🌗 Fully theme-aware: light/dark/system all work"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### Quick install (offline / dev)"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"> On the first install the host must restart to mount the plugin; afterwards a browser\n> hard-refres"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"h is enough to pick up rebuilt bundles."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## 中文 — 详细介绍"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### 它怎么工作"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"DSH 官方主题插件（`@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-theme`）提供 `theme` 服务，\n`ui-layout` 把当前主题快照的 token 以 inline CSS"},{"id":"p18s2","text":" 变量写到 `<body>`。\n本插件调用 `ctx.theme.overrideTokens(source, tokens)`，把 `--dsw-alias-*` 语义 token 的\n`{ lig"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"ht, dark }` 双配色表**叠加**到官方浅色/深色之上——右上角外观里的\n浅色 / 深色 / 跟随系统 三档照常工作。"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"### 功能清单"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"- **开关（v0.2.0）**：设置 → 常规 → Neo 皮肤，开启/关闭胶囊按钮，持久化在\n`localStorage: dsh-neo-skin.enabled`（默认开启）；关闭即回到官方配"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"色。\n- **双方案（v0.6.0）**：同一行「方案」选择器（蓝统治 / 做旧报纸），持久化在\n`dsh-neo-skin.scheme`，**实时切换**整套配色 + 结构覆写。\n- **结构层（"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"v0.3.0）**：硬偏移阴影（浅色黑 / 深色白，随主题）、关键面板直角化\n（`_card`/`_bubble`/`_panel`/`_code`/`_option`…）、2px 粗边框、按钮按下位"},{"id":"p20s4","text":"移反馈。\n- **语音插件适配（v0.5.0）**：`dsh-voice-input` 弹层/按钮/状态色主题化（它引用了\n不存在的 `--dsw-alias-*` token，走 fallback "},{"id":"p20s5","text":"会在浅色下黑底黑字，皮肤里已修正）。\n- **对比度纪律**：所有色面文字对比逐一校验（\"推荐\"徽章蓝底蓝字、深色主按钮蓝底黑字\n这类事故已修复）。"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"> 注意：结构层通过 `[class*=\"_xxx\"]` 可读后缀选择器命中组件（哈希变化不碎），\n> DSH 大版本重构类名时可能需要微调；圆形小元素（状态点、头像、spinner）保持圆形。\n>\n"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"> 为什么用 `localStorage` 而不是 `dsh-settings` 命名空间：host apiproxy 只对白名单\n> （`WEB_SETTINGS_NAMESPACES`）开放 `s"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"ettings.describe`，第三方插件注册的命名空间会得到\n> `settings-not-exposed`；官方把\"让插件自行暴露配置\"列为 deferred work。用 localSto"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"rage\n> 保证插件自包含、可直接发布，无需改 DSH 核心。"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"### 安装（离线开发）"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"### 调色 / 加新方案"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"- 每个方案一个目录项：`src/schemes/<name>.tokens.json`（light/dark 配色表）、\n`<name>.meta.json`（显示名）、`<name>.css`（方"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"案专属结构覆写）。\n- 改完跑 `npm run build`，浏览器硬刷新即可（无需重启 host）。\n- token 命名对齐官方 `design-platform.css`：`--dsw-ali"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"as-bg-*` / `border-*` / `label-*` /\n`button-*` / `interactive-*` / `state-*`，`--dsw-specific-*` 局部专用"},{"id":"p25s4","text":"s-bg-*` / `border-*` / `label-*` /\n`button-*` / `interactive-*` / `state-*`，`--dsw-specific-*` 局部专用。"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"### 目录结构"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
